      "description": "Advanced Hardware & Network Monitoring Dashboard for Gamers!\n\nGame Booster VIP Lag Fix & GFX is a modern system monitoring and hardware analysis utility designed to help gamers keep track of their device status. Safely monitor your hardware limits, test your network latency, and simulate graphical performance scenarios on a sleek, interactive dashboard.\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n\n• Real-Time Network Latency (Ping) Tracking: Keep an eye on your connection quality. Perform live ping tests to analyze network stability before or during your gaming sessions.\n• Live Memory (RAM) Monitoring: Monitor active memory utilization with clear, visual charts. Get transparent stats on used and available RAM instantly.\n• Device Temperature Monitor: Track your device's thermal status in real-time to observe heating trends and protect your hardware from extreme heat.\n• GFX Benchmark & Performance Simulation: Simulate the impact of various graphics qualities and frame rates (60, 90, 120, 144 FPS) on your device. Analyze simulated stability scores and get recommended profile insights.\n• Comprehensive Device Specifications: Access detailed information about your device, including CPU architecture, core count, storage availability, and chipset models from one consolidated screen.\n\nDISCLAIMER:\nOur application does not manipulate your physical hardware, overclock your CPU, or increase physical RAM. It is a dedicated system-monitoring and benchmarking utility designed to analyze, track, and provide transparent insights into your device's live performance parameters.",
